      "content": "thanks. it's a bit too short though. can we make it a little more detailed? i want to specifically mention that the \"creeping\" requirements are making it impossible to hit our original milestones without risking the stability of the whole system. maybe emphasize how these extra tasks keep sneaking in and derailing our sprint planning.",
